     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hi folks,</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><br>This week we will just have a worksession, so come and say hi, stay as long as you like (between 10-12), and work/code/etc.</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px\">Last week, Rich Pauloo gave a tutorial on using RMarkdown. All materials are up on the <a href=\"http://d-rug.github.io/blog/2017/Rich-Pauloo-on-using-RMarkdown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://d-rug.github.io/blog/2017/Rich-Pauloo-on-using-RMarkdown&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466667062000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Y-YpqDnfKolQqZobmRP-g\">website</a> now. We screencast the event, so if you want to rewatch, see the video </font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CHBOVuo6RCo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DCHBOVuo6RCo&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466667062000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2W23ZsYAsiSOF7UcO6LJjZ\">HERE</a>.</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><b><u>Upcoming Presentations:</u></b></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><ul><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Nov 16: Kate Tiedman:  <i><b>using raster /raster calculations in R</b></i></font></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Nov 30: Ryan Peek: <i><b>mapmaking with R/RStudio</b></i></font></li></ul></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><u><b><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><br></font></b></u></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><u><b><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">PACKAGE OF THE WEEK:</font></b></u></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Currently there are <b>11, 770</b> </span>total packages on <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(102,17,204);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466667062000&amp;usg=AOvVaw13panv15NVluLv3rxNQ6Ss\">CRAN</a>. </font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">A few packages this week, in both tidyverse and base R worlds. </font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><ul><li><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><b><a href=\"http://readxl.tidyverse.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://readxl.tidyverse.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466667062000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LpiiS-dai6uD1k6dBk_1t\">readxl</a>: </b>great for reading Excel based formats (both .xls and .xlsx) files</span></font></li><li><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><b><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/foreign/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/foreign/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466667062000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aCMgxbZ58VdzQSJ_ypY1i\">foreign</a>: </b>reads all kinds of different data types, </span></font>by &#39;Minitab&#39;, &#39;S&#39;, &#39;SAS&#39;, &#39;SPSS&#39;, &#39;Stata&#39;,\r\n&#39;Systat&#39;, &#39;Weka&#39;, &#39;dBase&#39;</li><li><b><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/googlesheets/vignettes/basic-usage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/googlesheets/vignettes/basic-usage.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466667062000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WluDFA2871ERCUmhGl_aS\">googlesheets</a>: </b>If you work in googledrive, this can be a really handy package. It plays well with/without pipes, and allows you to pull data directly from googlesheets. It&#39;s well written and documented as well. Double bonus.</li></ul></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Do you have a package you really enjoy using? Please send it/them my way! </span><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Here&#39;s a google form we can use to compile all of these: </span><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color:rgb(102,17,204);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/VzzeldnaEOkNImJ73\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(102,17,204);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/VzzeldnaEOkNImJ73&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466667062000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2AaveHrPcjpr5FVBtGxjoj\">https://goo.gl/forms/VzzeldnaEOkNImJ73</a>.</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color:rgb(102,17,204);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><br></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">If you want to see the packages that I&#39;ve mentioned thus far this quarter, there&#39;s a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vQH6BvP8p-YZOWpYFVIJYBa8AyscYgQB0Mone8NUKhlwKAA8UfGmUoIy22CO1AHOkNTR3Q4LSu2lvVm/pubhtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vQH6BvP8p-YZOWpYFVIJYBa8AyscYgQB0Mone8NUKhlwKAA8UfGmUoIy22CO1AHOkNTR3Q4LSu2lvVm/pubhtml&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466667062000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lS1Emi_d3Mmc1sZXDQ_pa\">table here</a>.</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><br></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Thanks much,</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Adios,<br>Ryan</font></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-lig